WEBVTT

00:09:58.969 --> 00:10:02.681
Well, its ability to capture
and store carbon over centuries

00:10:02.681 --> 00:10:05.059
is insured by that cold,

00:10:05.059 --> 00:10:08.187
because when organic matter
and litter fall to the ground,

00:10:08.187 --> 00:10:12.191
it decomposes extremely slowly
in its very deep soils.

00:10:12.524 --> 00:10:16.487
In fact, the boreal forest holds
twice as much carbon

00:10:16.528 --> 00:10:19.573
as the world's tropical
forests per hectare.

00:10:22.117 --> 00:10:24.536
(Applause)

00:10:24.578 --> 00:10:25.871
Yeah, go boreal!

00:10:25.871 --> 00:10:27.414
(Laughter)

00:10:27.456 --> 00:10:28.666
This is why I'm here.

00:10:28.707 --> 00:10:30.209
(Laughter)